GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "8B6FCD5C3404FA9C"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{FE636924C963F4C1}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Summary"
     m_sContent "<h2>Overview:</h2>"\
     "US special forces must conduct a Raid on a backline HQ that was hit with PGMs. The time is now before the intel is lost!"\
     ""\
     ""\
     "Overall CO is the Ranger HQ"
     m_eAudience 1
    }
    GC_Briefing "{8CD7CDA9DE55A61D}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "Situation"
     m_sContent "<h2>PRELIMS</h2>"\
     "<b>DTL:</b> 10/08/2009, 2200L, Takistan."\
     "<b>Weather:</b> Random"\
     "<h2>LORE</h2>"\
     "The country of Takistan has been invaded by coalition forces."\
     ""\
     "You are a part of a combined US/UK task force."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{545F00FC5D203D98}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "Enemy forces consist of approximately a SQD of TKA light infantry occupying the policestation. The position was previously cleared by GBUs from USN F/A-18s and is being harrased by blufor indirect fire."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Armed and armoured vehicles, static AAA have been spotted in the area."\
     "• The TKA have been losing this war and heavy armor is becoming rare."\
     "• Their familiarity with the location and surrounding terrain may allow them to effectively defend the position against our assault."\
     "•Once EN know we're in the area expect QRFs from the North and South."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1999333A29E368AD}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "<h2>COMPOSITION & DISPOSITION</h2>"\
     "We are <b>7th SFG GBs with 2nd RGR BTN and 160th SOAR</b>, consisting of 28 personnel. We are currently positioned at the southern airfield, preparing to conduct our mission."\
     ""\
     "<h2>STRENGTHS & CAPABILITIES</h2>"\
     "• Light infantry. We have x2 AH-6Ms in a CAS role."\
     "• We have x2 UH-60s with M134s and x2 MH-6s for transport."\
     ""\
     "<h2>SERVICE & SUPPORT</h2>"\
     "• No resupply or additional equipment is available for this operation."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{BA25F22DA0AFF30A}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "Mission"
     m_sContent "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT: Delta</h2>"\
     " Conduct a <b>RAID</b> to <b>SECURE</b> intel at the police HQ."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION STATEMENT: Rangers</h2>"\
     "Conduct a <b>BLOCK</b> to <b>SUPPORT</b> the Delta at the police HQ."\
     ""\
     "<h2>MISSION DESCRIPTION</h2>"\
     "We have received orders to secure documents from a TKA HQ that was a former police station. Our informant states that these documents have plans of upcoming operations in the region. He briefly saw the commander holding these earlier before going into the main building within the compound. He says the file has a red cover."\
     ""\
     "We are to move quickly and assault the station before the TKA can react. <b>STRIKE</b> hostile forces at the position and <b>SECURE</b> the intel, then <b>EXTRACT</b> all operators back to our airfield or if we loose our helicopters instead to the friendly marked lines were a British contigent is staging to extract us if need be."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{24CC301CB070E2F0}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "Comsig"
     m_sContent "<h2>CALLSIGNS</h2>"\
     "• RGR HQ Actual - 1'6 "\
     "• RGR HQ 2IC - 1'7"\
     "• RGR HQ FAC - GHOST"\
     "• WPN SQD - 1'4"\
     "• AT TEAM - 1'5"\
     "• DELTA - SPECTER"\
     "• UH-60 - VOODOO 1 and 2"\
     "• MH-6 - BAT 1 and 2"\
     "• AH-6 - KILLER 1 and 2"\
     ""\
     "<h2>CHANNELS</h2>"\
     "• GRND TF - 48hz"\
     "• AIR Coordination - 47.9hz"\
     "• CAS - 48.1hz"\
     ""\
     "<h2>PASSWORDS</h2>"\
     "• Challenge: Hot | Password: Dog"\
     "• Running password: 67"
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{1123F530DB547BB4}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "FLIGHT PLAN"
     m_sContent "The flight plan has been chosen to give the EN no opportunity to track our ingress and egress."\
     ""\
     "We are to fly NOE.(NAP OF THE EARTH)"\
     ""\
     "<h2>Order of March: </h2>"\
     "Fly with the Blackhawks on point to make use of their GPS MFDs, followed by MH-6, and AH-6 in tow to perform SEAD/DEAD upon contact on route."\
     ""\
     "<h2>In AO:</h2>"\
     "CAS has free fire zones, type 3, outside the AO. Be prepared for direct talk ons from the Rangers."\
     ""\
     "Transports are to orbit, conduct ISR, and direct CAS. Don't allow your airframes to be put into danger as we won't have a timely QRF to extract us."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "RHS_USAF"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{ABEF96303CDCE703}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "<h2>End Conditions:</h2>"\
     "<b>BLUFOR VICTORY1</b>"\
     "• Capture the intel, then extract to the office building back at the southern airfield."\
     ""\
     "<b>BLUFOR VICTORY2</b>"\
     "• Capture the intel, then extract to the friendly lines."\
     ""\
     "<b>BLUFOR VICTORY3</b>"\
     "• Lose the intel, then extract to the friendly lines."\
     ""\
     "<b>OPFOR VICTORY</b>"\
     "• US 80% KIA"\
     "• US all transpo destroyed"\
     ""\
     "<h2>Notes:</h2>"\
     "• JIP: TP."\
     "• There will be a hint at the beginning of the mission saying you won. IDK how to stop that but a popup will show when the intel is extracted. "
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
